<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-10T10:08:44.372Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 10:08:44 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran-linked drones attacked the Khor Mor gas field in Iraqi Kurdistan, halting production and cutting about 2.8 GW of power, while Iraqi forces carried out airstrikes on three suspected militants and a tunnel in Kirkuk’s Zghaitun Valley. Baghdad has reopened the Sheeb border crossing with Iran after a three-week closure and agreed to withdraw Turkish forces from the Zilkan base by the end of 2026. Iraqi officials are negotiating with armed groups and the US envoy called for stronger judicial ties with Iraq. 396 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news-analysis/2026/11/10/khor-mor-drone-attack-raises-fears-over-iraqs-energy-security?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxQRjlSd2FrSzRhU0tEbmROLW4tVVFKdVM2WnU5dzgwb1RJRkpTTUM4RV9ES3Q0cTZFSmFYaXZKalpUbVhZcDEyckNsWC1JV3E4QXlsVXBxSVM5RHlXZ1Z2Z21jMU1HMzg4Q1RxNm9sQ3JmWGsyUDBPQURDdVpxYzFscXJiOXNxSFl4MDZVTU0xQ3NGYTJoeUFGSWhKZTV1bjdGUWJlSTNueDRwbGdzMlZXZVpJUDA3c2Q5RVlndS1zU3JaeDJzd1BzeDNB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPcWh4Yk0xTEZlZXBHLTJQM08wNGY3bmZ0ZUp5YzhTQnc0V1FzS1dBdFJpQmtXRzZhMDQ3akQ4Y19CdTZ0NmZ6aVhUYXpQRzhEWGxUTExuUG0zVS14TmJrTk1aRnZPUXAyR0RURzJ4aHlDb1JmcHNMV05wWjJ5cEVicGRud2NGUjhXYkdENEVmU2pRRWl5RnkwbTd5ZzladFVrRlJYb2RuTTc1Tjc1Tnk1TE5WWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Saudi Gazette&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTE1xci1KS1J4NHN4emtoeklTbGQ0MnM1azdfTUpJMUFxeFJuanVGOV8tNG1xenJSNmlyS0hCejZXSmlFVGFMTVRFRDBpZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Region&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxOZXZRQTgzRHFrbTdoMGpuc0FodnhrdWVFZ2w5N1FLYWRhd0lzeEw4azdLMHplRzl4dk94ZXBzTVZjUUxtcEVleHlLQWdwY0ZhX1h